# merge 决策分支4：两边把同一文件改成相同内容则不动；
# 混入 given 新增文件以产生净改动，merge 成功且无冲突
> init
<<<
+ same.txt mbase.txt
> add same.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧：same.txt 改成同一新版本
+ same.txt msame.txt
> add same.txt
<<<
> commit "both change"
<<<

# given 侧：same.txt 也改成同一新版本，并新增 only.txt
> checkout other
<<<
+ same.txt msame.txt
> add same.txt
<<<
+ only.txt monlygiven.txt
> add only.txt
<<<
> commit "given same plus only"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
<<<

# same.txt 为共同新版本，only.txt 采纳 given 版本；无冲突、工作区干净
= same.txt msame.txt
= only.txt monlygiven.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master
other

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
